==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's shiny rare print features a {{shiny}} {{p|Venusaur}}.
*{{m|Mega Drain}} is a [[move]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that {{p|Venusaur}} can learn via [[TM]] in Generations {{gen|I}} and {{gen|VII}}.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Sword}}.

